--- signature of dining philosophers

fmod PHIL is
 protecting NAT .
 sort Phil .
 op N : -> NzNat [memo ]. --- the model's parameter
 eq N = 5 .
 op ph : Nat -> Phil [ctor] . --- the i-th philosopher
 var X : Nat .
 ceq ph(X) = ph(X rem N) if X >= N . --- equality mod-N 
endfm

view Phil from TRIV to PHIL is 
 sort Elt to Phil . 
endv